  "releaseNotes": "Cache the immutable configured channel origin instead of rebuilding it for every routed call. Preserve per-call paths, separate schema addresses, authentication, payload audit and masking hooks, cancellation, timeouts and handler ownership. Compatible with the 4.x wire format and schema hashes. This removes a small allocation; no stable end-to-end GET latency improvement is claimed. See CHANGELOG.md.",
